1. For Julie Transporters, the owner needs to remember things like:
    Bookings
    Vehicles
    Services
    Gallery images
    Testimonials
    Admin accounts
    Website settings
Those become our tables.


2. Tables
    admins          | id | name | email | password |
    bookings        | Booking Ref | Customer | Pickup | Destination |
    vehicles        the website will read them from the database.
                    Then the owner can add vehicles without touching code.
    services        
    gallery
    testimonials
    settings



